.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230726190359\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1c/Grabbiest2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230726190359 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1c/Grabbiest2.png/revision/latest?cb=20230726190359 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Unboxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Grabbiest2.png\" data-image-name=\"Grabbiest2.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a96c0163360d-1\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a96c0163360d-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Grabbiestunbox.png/revision/latest?cb=20230726192337\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Boxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Grabbiestunbox.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230726192337\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Grabbiestunbox.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230726192337 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Grabbiestunbox.png/revision/latest?cb=20230726192337 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Boxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Grabbiestunbox.png\" data-image-name=\"Grabbiestunbox.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Lighthouse</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$75,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows you to pick up even more objects at once for longer.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.30.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 26th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Grabbiest Grabber</b> is a tool which can be purchased for <b>$75,000</b> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>. It allows the user to project a large zone that lets them pick up multiple loose objects.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Grabbiest Grabber is a power gauntlet with a two-pronged claw on its end, built using the same materials that the refined tools use. It emits a harsh blue glow from its internal components.\n</p><p>The Grabbiest Grabber functions identically to the cheaper <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a>. However, the Grabbiest Grabber projects a much larger sphere of influence to grab objects with, allowing it to do things like pick up entire ore nodes in one go. The field the Grabbiest Grabber projects also lasts for 60 seconds, compared to the 12 seconds of the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Grabbiest Grabber (and its <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby counterpart</a>) have been involved with multiple in-game tricks/exploits that allow for flight. The developers frequently have to patch tricks players use to fly.</li>\n<li>Before the map revamp event, there was a sneak peak image of the Grabbiest Grabber in one of the thumbnails where <a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Fridman\" title=\"Bob Fridman\">Bob Fridman</a> is at the counter. The Boxed Grabbiest Grabber was at the shelf where, in the game at that time, the <a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\">Statistic Tools</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Jar\" title=\"Jar\">Jars</a> belonged.</li>\n<li>During the map update, the description of the Grabbiest Grabber was changed to refer to the Lighthouse rather than <a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">Jer's Junkyard</a> as the location where a player can buy the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a>.</li>\n<li>The Boxed image version of the Grabbiest Grabber doesn't look like the tool itself because it has a third grabber finger on the image, which bears more similarity to the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a>'s appearance.</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.5.0\" title=\"Version 1.5.0\">Version 1.5.0</a>, the Grabbiest Grabber was given a light-up bar, bringing it more in line with the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a>. This was previously absent.</li>\n<li>The Grabbiest Grabber is likely to be inspired in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://refinerycaves.fandom.com/wiki/Proton-24\">Proton-24</a> from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/8726743209/Refinery-Caves-1\">Refinery Caves</a> as it has got the same usage, idea, and it even references the game in its description as it mentions a word from the <i>refine</i> family.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901120750\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 69/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.526      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   27.526      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1395-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901120750 and revision id 15945. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Grabbers"],"links":[{"title":"Bob Fridman","exists":true},{"title":"Grabby Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Jar","exists":true},{"title":"Jer's Junkyard","exists":true},{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true},{"title":"Statistic Tool","exists":true},{"title":"Version 1.5.0","exists":true}],"images":["Grabbiest2.png","Grabbiestunbox.png"]}
